<title>CANADA: Cominco Ltd Q4 net profit sinks.</title>
<headline>Cominco Ltd Q4 net profit sinks.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.17		   C$0.44</p>
<p> Net			 14,100		   38,000</p>
<p> Revs		     465,400		  439,200</p>
<p>		  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.78		   C$1.22</p>
<p> Net			152,300		  103,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,743,900		1,534,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Full-year 1996 results include an after-tax gain on the sale of the Snip joint venture of C$19.3 million, or C$0.23 per share, and an after-tax gain on the sale of Brilliant Dam of $95.0 million, or C$1.12 per share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
